  "body": "There is no documentation for web developers on how to use the standard. Having examples in the specification is wrong because the audience for the specification is software developers, not web developers.\r\n\r\nI suggest two things, either create documentation for web developers such as tutorials or cease development and stop wasting your life working on a standard thst web developers don't know how to use.\r\n\r\nThe problem caused by the lack of documentation for web developers is evident by the fact that 99% of webpages don't comply with standards. People end up learning from shitty non-authoritive tutorials written by 'experts' floating around the web which are wrong.",
